md=['# Czech cycling 2027: completed production import — 31 October 2026','', '## Result','', '**13 new public race records, 23 existing records enriched, 2 main-batch records already correct, and 1 Lesák duplicate merged with relationships and recoverable history preserved.** The 23 updates include two retained noncompetitive rides and the hidden Lost Ride draft. The reviewed main batch therefore has **35 publicly listed races, two rides outside the race calendar, and one TBC draft**. Two additional existing races were checked unchanged; two additional uncertain discoveries were saved in the review queue and one recreational event was excluded.','', 'The supplied request contains 26 named event groups, despite the headline counts of 22; all 26 were processed. Twelve additional groups were implemented/reviewed with the batch, and five more discoveries assessed: **43 investigated groups total**. Route variants are included within their event where the existing model supports that. Bike Paradise and Půl Paradise keep their two pre-existing independent route records; no duplicate was created.','', 'All production changes were executed, not left as a proposed script. Verification snapshots, complete previous values and current values are stored beside this report.','', '## A. Added and published','', '| Event | Date | Database ID | Public page | Official source | Registration |','|---|---|---|---|---|---|']
