md+=['','## B. Updated in place','','All IDs and previous editions are preserved. Every changed field has a previous-value fact record; the complete before/after data is in `apply-before.json`, `after.json` and `actions.json`. Category rows are updated in place when matched; old category evidence is archived before changes.','','| Event / ID | Before → after | Reason / source |','|---|---|---|']
