md+=['','## D. Pending and policy exclusions','','- **Lost Ride**: existing event `ce93409c-87ee-4886-8ff9-5a07000b0dc0` remains `tbc` / hidden. The official homepage and news advertise 2027 registration, but the organiser explicitly allows a ±1–2 day shift from 1 June and has not disclosed either venue. The supported partial record already exists and was enriched; no invented map pin or final date was published. Next: replace date and locality from an explicit organiser announcement. [Homepage](https://lost-ride.cz/) · [News](https://lost-ride.cz/news).','']
