md+=['','- **Oremon Krušky Open** and **Brdský Meandr**: their existing `ride` records are retained, with clear descriptions. The app supports storing them, but the main public race feed explicitly excludes `event_type=ride` (`src/lib/events.ts`). They were not relabelled as competitive races to force calendar visibility. Oremon explicitly calls itself a social ride; Brdský Meandr is the organiser’s noncompetitive completion challenge. [Oremon](https://oremon.cz/en/home_en/) · [Meandr](https://www.bike-meandr.cz/brdsky-meandr/).','- **Fanatik Plzeň**: organiser confirms 19 June 2027 but explicitly states it is not a race. No competitive race record was fabricated. [Source](https://www.fanatik-plzen.cz/).','','## E. Discrepancies resolved or isolated','','| Issue | Decision and evidence |','|---|---|','| Moravia Divide 28 vs 29 May / 2026 typo | Keep **28 May 2027**. Official year-labelled [2027 calendar](https://ultrabikers.eu/calendar-2027/) gives Friday 28 May; detailed page gives May 27 presentation, May 28 start and June 3 finish. Aggregator May 29 rejected. |','| Moravia Divide short distance | English detailed page says 620 km; Czech 650 with 660 at the finish point; generic calendar 650. Main route ~850 km is consistent on detailed pages. Keep the short variant but remove one falsely precise numeric length; preserve all conflicting evidence. |','| Race Across Czechia registration | Both current detailed pages and registration page say **29 November, 20:15** (2026 in the upcoming 2027 edition). Prior/priority-registration messages remain inconsistent and are not treated as a reliable opening. Replaced broken `/racz27-info/` by [working `/racz27/`](https://raceacross.cz/racz27/). |','| Race Across Czechia distances/elevation | Detailed English and Czech pages agree on ~1100 / 800 km; generic/rest-point text still includes 1150/820 km. Main numeric distances remain approximate; conflicting elevation is not assigned as a precise value. |','| Seven Wineyards distances/elevation | Current [event-specific organiser page](https://raceacross.cz/ub30-seven-wineyards/) gives UB30 ~1200/9000 and UB20 ~900/7000. Overrides outdated aggregator 800/8000, 1200/11000 and general calendar 1100/800. Own-route nature is explained. |','| Seven Wineyards registration | Detailed event page gives **29 Nov 2026, 20:30**; standalone form says 2025 and still has old copy. Retain future opening from event page, remove stale registration action link. |','| European MTBO schedule | [Current programme](https://emtboc2027.cz/en/programme/) takes precedence over February announcement: May 5 sprint, 6 middle, **7 relays**, **8 long**. Existing competition rows already use this schedule. |','| World Cup festival vs racing | Main record already correct: **May 21–23 racing**, May 20–23 festival described separately. UCI Junior XCO 80464 remains within the same weekend; no Junior XCO World Cup claim and no unconfirmed junior XCC. |','| Oremon route | Current English homepage agrees with Czech **310 km / 5100 m**; previous 322/6068 figures superseded. Remains noncompetitive ride. |','| SPOKE date vs weekday rule | Browser-visible official heading and programme explicitly display **28 Aug 2027**. The agent did not project last year’s date. Site itself auto-rolls dates, so this source limitation is retained. Timing form still shows 29 Aug 2026; it is not attached as 2027 registration. |','| Lesák 2027 vs 2026 programme | **28 Aug 2027, centre of Červený Kostelec** is the new announcement; Bohdašín / 45 and 20km / detailed times belong to 2026. No 2026 route categories or regulations claimed as 2027; high-level ages marked previous. |','| Podkrkonošský regulations vs registration | [2027 regulations](https://www.sportchallenge.cz/cz/podkrkonosskymaraton/2027/propozice) confirm **31 July**, 30/53/90km MTB, 53km gravel and children/family options. False “already happened” registration message does not change race status. |','| Krakonoš / Hradec | Existing dates already correct: **12 June / 30 May**. Hradec supplemented with 30/60km, children and organiser’s venue. |','| JES300 | Official 2027 calendar says **Velké Losiny**, overriding aggregator Šumperk. Two route variants in one new event. |','| Montes Ferrei | Existing **16 June 2027** matches official homepage; aggregator June 18 rejected. |','| Bike Paradise venues | Máchalův mlýn identified as Střehomský/Opočenský mlýn at Střehom, Dolní Bousov; both existing route records receive coordinates. Historical 2026 300km not claimed for 2027. |','| Poslední míle | Calendar’s **22–24 October 2027 weekend** is published; precise riding timetable pending. Prize-invitation text elsewhere mentions 16/23 October and is not treated as the full event schedule. |','','## F. Implementation and validation','','- Production project: `xlomrxswdcekarazaahx` / letsrace. No schema migration, no authentication or user-data change.','- **43 investigated event groups**: 26 named in the request + 17 extra groups.','- **13 inserted public race records**, **23 updated event records**, **4 existing correct groups** (2 main + Montes + Vabank), **1 duplicate merged**. 25 applied candidates reuse existing IDs instead of creating duplicates; two more existing groups are checked read-only. Two additional candidates saved as `waiting`.','- Outcome for the 38-record applied batch: **35 scheduled public races**, **2 preserved noncompetitive rides**, **1 hidden TBC draft**. The three noncompetitive groups including Fanatik are intentionally excluded from the default race calendar.','- 689 field-level audit facts plus an atomic batch-complete marker were recorded. Existing overrides are merged, never discarded. Verified identity, dates, classification, location, routes and registration decisions are locked against later automatic replacement.','- Existing source identifiers, series links and organiser sources were inspected; this schema has no separate organisers/aliases/variants tables. `event_sources`, `event_series`, `event_categories`, existing slugs, the protected fields and merge history are the native mechanisms. New UltraBikers rounds link to its existing series.','- Transaction guarded by advisory lock, before-value assertions and same-name/date/slug duplicate detection. It is idempotent via a completion marker. Full snapshots are recoverable in the report folder; standard `app_merge_events` preserves source evidence, user relationships and merge history.','- All **38 applied records** reread from production: dates/status/visibility, Czech locations, coordinates for every public race, source links, date locks, MTBO tags and duplicate merge checked.','- Public check: all **35 eligible race IDs appear in the 2027 Czech calendar API**; their detail URLs return HTTP 200 with the event name. Rides and Lost Ride are absent from the default race feed as expected.','- Tests: **181 files, 1231 tests passed**, including MTBO normalization, parent/leaf filtering and avoiding XCO false matches. Changed-file lint passes.','- Initial whole-checkout typecheck/build sees a pre-existing incomplete archived source copy under `reports/search-console-2026-10-29/release-source/` and fails on missing `race-skeleton`. Release validation uses a clean source copy excluding local reports; the clean release build passes, including TypeScript and 135 generated pages. Deployment verification is recorded below.','- The connected Vercel cache endpoint returned 404; the official CLI successfully purged the project’s CDN and data caches.','','### Discovery coverage and limits','','Checked the supplied federation/organiser/aggregator routes, across road, TT, MTB, gravel, MTBO, ultra and children; also searched current BMX, cyclocross, downhill/enduro, track and trials announcements. No dates were inferred from previous editions.','','| Source | Result / limitation |','|---|---|','| Czech Cycling Federation homepage | Retrieved; related 2027 road/MTB records already present. Track/trials searches did not establish further missing 2027 Czech dates. |','| Cyclocross calendar | Retrieved; no further sufficiently confirmed missing 2027 Czech candidate found in this scan. |','| Czech BMX calendar | Direct requests timed out/failed; search-indexed official calendar/downloads still centred on 2026. This is incomplete coverage, not proof no 2027 dates exist. |','| MTBO federation | Retrieved federation announcement and current international calendar; seven requested Czech weekends retained; Austrian Bad Traunstein not imported as Czech. |','| UCI MTB calendar | Reviewed current official calendar/search output and Junior 80464; existing Czech cup and NMNM records prevent duplicate imports. |','| ZavodyNaKole / Winspace | Retrieved; differences compared with organiser pages rather than promoted blindly. |','| BezPodpory 2027 | Retrieved and followed organiser links; discovered Toulání/Touláníčko, JES300 and other cup dates. Date/distance discrepancies resolved against primary pages. |','| UltracyclingHub | Retrieved; Bohemian provisional date sent for review, Lost Ride remains TBC. |','| Edie Cycling Team 2027 route | Repeated direct/search-access fetches failed/timed out. Not represented as a completed calendar audit. |','| Bike Paradise / Oremon | Direct fetch met security challenges; readable indexed official pages were used; no challenge solved or registration state invented. |','','## G. Export and evidence','','`events.csv` is UTF-8 and contains all 43 groups: confirmed/provisional dates, locality/region/coordinates, disciplines, public/official/registration URLs, event/candidate IDs, verification outcome and action. Draft tentative dates are in their own column. Source snapshots are in `sources/`; `public-checks.json`, `public-calendar.json`, `after.json`, `apply-before.json`, `actions.json`, `apply.sql`, `review-queue*.json/sql` retain the audit trail.','']
